# .evolution-lock
# Files listed here may NEVER be modified by the self-evolution loop.
# Any diff touching these paths is hard-rejected before reaching the human gate.
# To change this list, a human must edit this file directly outside the loop.

# The security policy itself — the guard cannot guard itself
src/evolution/security.rs

# The gate runner — the gate cannot be modified by what it gates
src/evolution/validator.rs

# This file — the lock cannot unlock itself
.evolution-lock

# The benchmark baseline — only updatable via /baseline or --update-baseline
benchmarks/baseline.json

# Dependency pinning — must be reviewed by a human when changed
Cargo.lock
